<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Filipi</book>
  <para style="h">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipi</para>
  <para style="mt">Filipi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula leh Timothea, Krista Isua bawihte chuan, Krista Isuaa mi thianghlim Filipi khuaa awm zawng zawng leh, Kohhran hotute leh rawngbâwltute chibai kan bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In chanchin ka ngaihtuah apiangin ka Pathian hnênah lâwmthu ka sawi ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />eng hunah pawh in zavaia tân ka ṭawngṭai apiangin hlim takin ka ṭawngṭai ṭhîn a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />in hriat tirh ni aṭangin tûn thlenga Chanchin Ṭha hril hna mi thawhpui ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmahnia he thil ṭha tichhuaktu chuan Krista Ni-a a puitlin thlengin a thawh zêl ka ring tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ngai êm êm ṭhîn che u a, Pathianin he chanvo mi pêk Chanchin Ṭha tâna ka beihnaah te, tihngheh hna ka thawhnaah te leh ka kawl bunah te min ṭanpuitu in nih avângin ka thinlungah in awm reng a, in zaa chungah chutiang rilru pu âwm rêng pawh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Krista Isua rilru ka ṭâwmpui avângin in zain ka ngai êm êm che u a ni tih Pathianin a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In hmangaihna chu hriatnaah te, thil hmuh fiah thiamna tinrêngah te ṭhang liana a pun deuh deuh theih nân ka ṭawngṭai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, thil ṭha bîkte chu in thlang thiam ang a, Krista Nî-ah chuan thianghlim leh sawisêlbo in lo ni ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian ropui nân leh fak nân Krista zâra felna rah chuan in lo khat dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute u, ka thil tuarte kha chanchin Ṭha tihdarhna tûr a lo ni ta hlauh zâwk tih in hriat ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka kawl bunte hi Krista vâng a ni tih lal in vêngtuho leh mi dang zawng zawng pawhin an hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unau tam zâwkte pawhin ka kawl bun avângin Lalpa an ring nghet sauh va, hlau lovin Pathian thu pawh an hril ngam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat chuan îtsîkna leh elrelna avângin Krista thu an hril ve ṭhîn a, ṭhenkhat erawh chuan rilru ṭha takin an hril ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha ṭan tûra ruat ka nih hriain hmangaih avânga hril an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ṭhenkhat zawngin ti tak tak lovin, inerna avâng leh ka chungthu hi rip zual se an tih avânga hril an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pawi lo ve, a derin emaw, a takin emaw, engti kawng emaw tala Krista thu hrilh a ni hi a lâwmawm e, ka lâwm zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min ṭawngṭaisakna avâng leh Isua Krista Thlarau ṭanpuina avângin chhan chhuah ka ni dâwn tih ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka duhthusâm ber leh ka beisei tlat chu, engah mah ka mualpho lohva, huai taka eng hunah pawh, tûn ṭumah ngei pawh hian, damin emaw, thîin emaw ka taksaa Krista chawimawi hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei zawng Krista tâna nung ka ni a, thi mah ila ka tân chuan a hlâwk zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dam zêl ila ṭangkaina ka la nei dâwn bawk si a; a eng nge thlan zâwk tûr ka hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ngaihna tak pawh ka hre lo ve, kal chhuaha Krista hnêna awm châkna ka nei a, chu chu a ṭha zâwk tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nangmahni avângin la dam reng a ṭûl bawk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In zaa rinna tiṭhang tûr leh in lâwmna tipung tûrin ka dam zêl dâwn tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka lo kal leh hunah chuan keimah avângin Krista in la fak lehzual dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi dangte nêna in khawsak ho dân chu Krista Chanchin Ṭha nên inmawi phawt sela, ka lo kal emaw, kal lo emaw, thlarau hmun khata ding nghetin, rilru hmun khat puin Chanchin Ṭha rinna chu in ṭan tlâng tih ka hre thei ang. Tichuan, dotute chu engti kawng maha hlau lovin huai takin awm ula; chu chu an hneh dawn lo che u a, in hneh zâwk dâwn tih tichiangtu a ni ang. Chu chu Pathian tih a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Krista ring tûr chauh ni lovin, a tâna tuar tûr pawhin rawngbâwl hna hi in chang a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Indona ka tawh in hmuh ṭhin, tûnah pawh ka tâwk zêl tih in hriat ang kha in tâwk ve ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Krista zârah thlamuanna in nei ta a, a hmangaihna chuan a tilâwm che u a, Thlarau pâwlna in chang a, inlainatna leh inkhawngaihna in nei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, lungrual taka inhmangaih tawnin, inthuruala rilru hmun khat puin, ka lâwmna tikim rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahni hmasial tak leh inngaihlu taka eng mah ti lovin, tu pawhin inngaitlâwm takin mi dangte ṭha zâwkah dah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mahni ṭhatna tûr chauh zawng lovin, mi dang ṭhatna tûr pawh zawng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Krista Isua rilru ang hi nangni pawhin pu zêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chu Pathian anpui ni mah sela, Pathian tluka awm chu tum tlat tûrah a ngai lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mahni intitlâwmin bawihah a insiam a, mihringa lo piangin mihring a lo ni ngei na a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a inngaitlâwm a, thi khawp hialin thu a zâwm a, krawsah a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Pathianin ani chu a chawimawi nasa ta ber a, hming zawng zawnga hming chungnung ber a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chawimawiin mi tin, vâna mi te, leia mi te, lei hnuaia mi te a hmaah an ṭhingṭhi ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pa Pathian ropui nân mi tinrêngin, “Isua Krista chu Lalpa a ni,” tiin an puang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, ka duh takte u, ka awm laia ka thu in awih ang khân, tûna ka awm loh hlân pawh hian in awih lehzual a ṭûl a ni. Pathian hlau leh ṭih tak chungin in chhandamna tifamkim tûrin thawk zêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama duhzâwng tih tum tûr leh ti thei tûra nangmahnia thawktu chu Pathian a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Phunnawi lo leh hnial lovin engkim ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûnlai mi bengtla lo leh tihmawhte zîngah hian Pathian fa, sual nei lo, nun tlang, sawisêlbo in nih theihna tûr leh, khawvêl tiêngtute in nih theihna tûrin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nunna thu chu vuan zêl rawh u; tichuan, Krista Nî-ah chuan ka chhuan tûr in ni ang a, ka tlân thlâwn lova, ka thawkrim thlâwn lo tih a lang dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In rinna rawngbâwlna leh inthawinaah chuan kei hi hlanin awm dâwn pawh ni ila ka lâwm ang, nangni pawh ka lâwmpui bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni pawh lâwm ula, mi lâwmpui bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In chanchin hriaa ngaihṭha taka ka awm theih nân, Lalpa Isuan rem a tih chuan in hnênah Timothea rawn tirh thuai theih ka inbeisei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tihtakzeta kei anga ngaihtuah ve che u chu ani chauh hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi dang zawngin Isua Krista tân ngaihtuah lovin, mahni tân an zawng si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani erawh hi chu a ṭangkaizia in hre tawh a, pa leh fa thawk dûn angin Chanchin Ṭha rawng kan bâwl dun ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka chanchin tûr ka hriat veleh ani hi ka rawn tirh nghâl theih ka beisei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpan rem a tih chuan keimah ngei pawh hi lo kal thuai theih ka inring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ka unaupa, ka sipaipui, ka rawngbâwlpui, ka mamawh phuhrûk tûra in rawn tirh Epafrodita hi in hnêna rawn tirh ṭûlin ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In za-in a ngai êm êm che u a, a na tih in lo hria chu pawi a ti hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thih ngama nâ zawng a ni ngei a; mahse, Pathianin a khawngaih a, ani chang ni lovin, kei mi khawngaih pawh a ni bawk ang chu, lungngaih lehzualna tâwk lovin mi siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, amah in lo hmuha in lâwm nân leh, ka mangan a reh theih nân ani hi ka rawn tîr vat a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani hi Lalpa hmingin hlim takin lo lâwm ula, hetiang mi hi ngaihlu rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangmahni ngeiin kuta min ṭanpui phâk si loh avângin thih dâwn lovin Krista hna a thawk a, a thih phah ṭhelh nghe nghe a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan ka unaute u, Lalpaah lâwm rawh u. Thu pângngai bawk ziak leh ṭhin hi keia tân ninawm a ni lo va, in tân a sâwt bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ui lakah te, thil ṭha lo titu lakah te, serh tan uarho lakah te fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keini Pathian Thlarau zâra Pathian bia leh Krista Isua chhuanga, pâwn lam thila innghat lote hi serh tan dik tak kan ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Duh ila chuan kei pawhin pâwn lam thil chhuan tûr chu ka nei asin. Miin pâwn lam thil chhuang theia an inhriat chuan kei ka inhre lehzual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni riat nia serh tan, Israel thlaha mi, Benjamina chia mi, Hebrai nu leh pa kâra piang ka ni. Dân zawm lamah chuan Farisai ka ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ṭhahnemngaih lamah lah kohhran tiduhdahtu ka ni a. Dânin a phût ang hlen thu-ah pawh sawisêlbo ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thil, ka tâna hlâwk tûr apiangte chu, Krista avângin hlohna zâwkah ka ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu chang a ni lo, ka Lalpa Isua Krista hriatna hlu tak avângin thil engkim hi hlohnaah ka ngai a; Krista chu ka neih theih nân leh amah nên pumkhat kan nih theih nân, amah avângin engkim ka chân ta vek a, chûng chu bawlhhlawh ang lekah ka ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thiam chang ka nihna chu Dân zawm vâng ni lovin, Krista rin vâng zâwk a ni a, rin vânga Pathian hmaa thiam channa chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thil duh chu Krista hriat te, a thawhlehna thiltihtheihna chan te, a tuar anga tuar te, a thihna ṭâwmpui te hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, mitthi thawhlehna chu ka chang ve dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hêng hi ka chang tawh ka ti lo ve, famkim tawh pawh ka inti hek lo; Krista mi man chhan chu tihlawhtling ngei tûrin ka la bei zêl zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute u, hlawhtling tawhah ka inngai lo ve, thil pakhat erawh chu ka ti ṭhîn, thil kal tawhte chu theihnghilha, hma lam thilte chu thlîr zâwkin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista Isuaa Pathian chung lam kohna lâwmman chu hmu tûrin, tiam chin lam chu ka pan ngat ngat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, keini puitling tawhte hian chutiang rilru chu i pu ang u. Ngaih dân dang nei in awm a nih pawhin Pathianin a la tihfiahsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eng pawh ni se, kan thlen chin aṭang khân hma i sâwn zêl ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unaute u, ka awm dân hi zir zêl rawh u. Entawn tûr keini min nei a, kan awm dân anga awmte chu en berah neih rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An khawsak dâna Krista kraws hmêlma tam tak an awm tih ka hrilh fo che u kha, tûnah pawh ṭap chungin ka hrilh nawn leh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûngho tâwpna chu chhiatna a ni. Ei tûr hi pathianah an neih a, zahpui tûr thilte chu an la chhuang ta zâwk a, khawvêl thil chauh an ngaihtuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keini zawng vân khua-leh-tui kan ni si a, min chhandamtu Lalpa Isua Krista vân aṭanga lo kal tûr chu nghâkhlel takin kan thlîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engkim a thuhnuaia dah theitu chuan kan taksa tlâwm tak hi ama taksa ropui anga awm tûrin a thiltihtheihna chuan a tidanglam dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka unau duh tak leh ngaih êm êm, ka lâwmna leh mi chawimawitu duh takte u, chutiang chuan Lalpaah ding nghet rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpaa rilru hmun khat pu tûrin Euodii leh Suntuki kha ka ngên e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni, nang, ka nghâwngkawl bahpui rinawm tak, khâng hmeichhiate kha ṭanpui tûrin ka sâwm a che; anni chuan, Klemena leh Nunna Bû-a hming chuang dangte nên Chanchin Ṭha hrilh hnaah mi thawhpui nasa si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpaah chuan lâwm fo rawh u, ka sawi nawn leh ṭhîn ang, lâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In dawhtheihzia mi zawng zawng hriat ni rawh se. Lalpa chu a hnai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engah mah mangang suh u, eng thilah pawh ṭawngṭaiin, in mamawh chu Pathian hnênah thlen ula, lâwmthu hril zêl chungin dîl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, mihring hriat sên rual loh Pathian thlamuanna chuan, in thinlung leh in rilrute chu Krista Isuaah chuan a vênhimsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan unaute u, a dik leh zahawm apiang, a fel leh thianghlim apiang, a duhawm leh thangmawi apiang, a ṭhata, fak tlâk a nih phawt chuan, chûng chu ngaihtuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hnên aṭanga in thil zir leh dawn te, in thil hriat leh hmuhte kha ti zêl rawh u. Tichuan, thlamuanna Pathian chuan a awmpui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In mi ngaihtuahzia tûn hnaia in rawn tihlan leh theih tâk avângin Lalpaah chuan ka lâwm takmeuh a ni. Chutiang tih chu in tum reng a, remchâng in la hmu rih lo mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tlâkchham thu sawi zawng ka ni lo ve; eng ang pawhin awm ila lungawi ka zir tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rethei taka awm dân ka thiam a, hausa taka awm dân pawh ka thiam bawk a; engkimah tlai leh rilṭâma awm dân, hausa leh retheia awm dân thurûk ka zir tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi tichaktu avângin eng pawh tâwk tûrin chakna ka nei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, ka mangannate mi lo hriatpui ṭhîn hi in ti ṭha e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Chanchin Ṭha ka hrilh ṭan laia Makedonia ka chhuahsan hnu khân nangni Filipi-ho chauh lo chuan kohhran dang pakhat mahin sum hman tûr mi ngaihtuahpui an awm lo tih in hria e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thesalonika khuaa ka awm lai pawhin ka tlâkchham phuhrûk tûrin vawi khat chang ni lovin, vawi hnih lai thilpêk mi rawn thawn kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thil pêk ka zawng lo ve, in tâna thlarau lam rah tûr chu ka zawng zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In thilpêk zawng zawng ka lo dawng a, ka ngah ta e. Epafrodita kuta in thil rawn thawnte pawh ka lo hmu a, ka phuisui ta e. Chu chu thilhlan rimtui pawm tlâk, Pathian lâwm zawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka Pathian chuan Krista Isuaa a hausakna ropui tak aṭangin in mamawh tinrêng a pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Pathian leh kan Pa chu chatuanin ropui rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi thianghlim zawng zawng Krista Isua hmingin chibai ka bûk e. Ka hnêna unau awmte hian chibai an bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi thianghlim zawng zawngin chibai an bûk a che u, Kaisara ina awmte hian an bûk deuh bîk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
